# OFF compatibility template used by production Compose.
# Gateway CN must equal Gateway.id; existing onboarding keeps its scoped patterns.
# NEVER add command-set identities to this OFF template: global patterns would
# give them non-Set rights. Explicit cutover must REPLACE this file with
# renderMosquittoAcl(fullGatewayCensus, { setGeneration: N }); that renderer
# removes both legacy Set writes, replaces patterns with explicit Gateway users,
# and gives command-set-N only dimming write. Stock ACL rollback is not prevented.
# Production cutover, purge and recovery POST remain OFF.
# This file is rollbackable configuration, not BrokerGenerationFence evidence.
# Revoking its publisher ACL does not erase subscriber persistent sessions/queues.
# Restoring old ACL + CRL can revive an old credential after broker restart.
# Every node needs an external immutable minimum-generation admission and CA
# revocation ledger before production retirement can ever be certified.
user api-service
topic write sites/health/production-probe
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/acks/acceptance
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/acks/device-status
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/state/fixtures
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/state/fixture-presence
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/state/heartbeat
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning/scan-found
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning/scan-completed
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning/scan-failed
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning/device-terminal
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning-completed
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning-failed
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/identify-result
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/fixture-presence-check-completed
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/fixture-unreachable
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/mesh-group/resync-request
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/mesh-group/subscription-result
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/mesh-node-metrics
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/provisioning-progress
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/automation/config-applied
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/automation/current-config-request
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/automation/execution
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/automation/vehicle-sensor-capability
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/commands/clock/request
topic read sites/+/gateways/+/events/drain/response
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/status-check
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/identify
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/fixture-presence-check
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/provisioning/scan-start
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/provisioning/scan-stop
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/provisioning/identify-device
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/provisioning/provision-device
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/mesh-group/subscription-sync
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/mesh-group/resync-ack
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/automation/config-sync
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/events/clock/response
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/drain/request
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/state-ingested
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/fixture-presence-check-completed
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/provisioning/scan-terminal-ingested
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/provisioning/device-terminal-ingested
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/automation/config-applied-ingested
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/automation/execution-ingested
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/acks/automation/vehicle-sensor-capability-ingested
# Transitional legacy Set: remove both writes only during coordinated cutover.
topic write sites/+/gateways/+/commands/dimming
topic write sites/+/commands/dimming

# OFF-only Gateway scoped compatibility grants.
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/commands/#
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/events/clock/response
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/commands/clock/request
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/state-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/fixture-presence-check-completed
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/provisioning/scan-terminal-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/provisioning/device-terminal-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/automation/config-applied-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/automation/execution-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/automation/vehicle-sensor-capability-ingested
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/acceptance
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/device-status
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/state/#
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/events/#
